# Crumple Zone: extra procnto options (sourced by mkqnximage as bash).
# @CZ_PROC_OPTIONS@ is filled in by image/build-image.sh (empty by default).
# CZ_NOHALT=1 passes -h (no CPU halt in the idle thread). It trims about 20 us of
# emulator wake-up latency under QEMU TCG, but in our runs it led to a hang:
# two CPUs looping in the TLB-invalidation path (x86_64_as_inv) while the third
# spun in the idle loop. It is off by default and kept only for experiments.
PROC_OPTIONS="@CZ_PROC_OPTIONS@"
